Usage: memo [options] [command]

context about people across messengers, notes and mail

Options:
  -V, --version                        output the version number
  --debug                              on failure, show the full error record:
                                       cause and stack
  -h, --help                           display help for command

Commands:
  context [options] <person>           messages, mail and notes about a person,
                                       each with a link to its source
  notes                                notes from your folders, and notes you
                                       write here
  folders                              folders of notes: the id links and the
                                       store use, and the path on this computer
  messages                             stored emails; tg and max read messenger
                                       messages
  mail                                 look at a mail account before importing
                                       it, and the owner's rules
  note [options] <identity> [path]     name the note that is about a person, or
                                       show it
  tags                                 your labels on stored sources and folders
                                       or threads
  tasks                                open work linked to stored messages,
                                       documents and emails
  stats                                statistics about what the store holds
  organizations                        companies, teams, families and
                                       communities of yours
  projects                             projects of yours, each with a short key
  relationships                        relations between people, organizations
                                       and projects; never between identities
  reminders                            durable local reminders; poll hands one
                                       out and ack confirms it was shown
  vocabulary                           canonical projects, tags and topics with
                                       explicit aliases
  memories                             what agents and you concluded, with
                                       evidence; you confirm an agent's
  mentions                             phones, e-mail, links, names and
                                       addresses in documents, notes and mail
  facts                                what happened — said, asked, decided,
                                       promised — with evidence
  meetings                             stored meeting evidence and reviewed
                                       findings
  actions                              what an agent proposes to do; confirming
                                       one makes it your task, nothing is sent
  agents                               what agents did through the MCP servers
                                       that share the store
  mcp                                  serve memories, proposed actions and the
                                       agent log over MCP on stdin and stdout
  search                               search stored messages, mail, notes and
                                       memories; search all when unsure where
  ask [options] <question> [query...]  prepare cited evidence for your agent, or
                                       explicitly call a configured model
  sync [options]                       bring notes and mail up to date in the
                                       store, only what changed
  auto                                 run memo sync on a systemd user timer,
                                       set in the config
  doctor [options]                     where memo keeps its files and what needs
                                       attention; connects to nothing
  upgrade [options]                    upgrade memo with the package manager
                                       that installed it; --check only looks
  commands [options] [path...]         discover the command tree and options as
                                       shared registry data
  skill                                the instructions an agent is given for
                                       this tool
  help [command]                       display help for command
